# Agent Workflow

## When changing code

- Match existing patterns in `users` / `auth` / `profile` before inventing new ones
- Prefer small, focused diffs — no drive-by refactors
- Completing a feature means: schema + DTOs + real service + guards + Serialize + ApiMessage
- Ask before changing body parsing (form-data ↔ JSON) or public/auth policy

## Git

- Commit **only** when the user explicitly asks
- Push **only** when the user explicitly asks
- Never force-push to `master`/`main` unless the user clearly requests it
- “رجّع / ارجع الكود” means **revert/restore**, not push
- If Arabic is ambiguous (كوميت / ارفع / ارجع), ask one short clarifying question first

## Category module note

`category` may still be scaffold/stub. When implementing it, upgrade to the users golden path — don’t leave placeholder service methods.
